  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A Material Variant is a material with a parent. It takes every setting from its parent, except the ones it overrides. The concrete parent here has two variants: Dark overrides the base colour; Wet overrides the base colour and the smoothness. Change the parent, and every setting a variant has not overridden follows.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Set the parent's Smoothness to 0.8. Which spheres become shinier?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select M_Train_Concrete and set Smoothness to 0.8.\n2. Select M_Train_Concrete-Wet and find the settings it overrides.\n3. Revert its Smoothness override, and watch sphere 3.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Material chart, 2 \xB7 Everyday materials (Concrete)</color></size>"
