  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Make the materials for your own reference image, untextured, at real values: a metal, a non-metal and an emissive surface. Then make one parent with two Material Variants, for example clean and wet. Keep them in your library: the next scenes use them.\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Look up: choose three or four surfaces in your reference and find their values in the Material chart.\n2. Make: create a URP Lit material for each in your own folder; set base colour, metallic, smoothness and, for the emissive one, Emission.\n3. Vary: create a parent and two variants; change the parent and check that the variants follow.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Material chart \xB7 Lit shader</color></size>"
