      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Emission makes a surface show its own colour, even in the dark.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Does the sign light the white wall and the floor around it?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Add a Point Light in front of the sign (GameObject \u203A Light \u203A Point Light).\n2. Give it the sign's colour.\n3. Set a small Range.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Lit shader, 2 \xB7 Emission</color></size>"
