  m_text: "Metallic sets metal (1) or non-metal (0). Smoothness sets how sharp the reflection is, from matte (0) to mirror (1).\n\n<b>Predict:</b> All four spheres have the same base colour. Which sphere is a smooth metal?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Check each material's Metallic and Smoothness.\n2. Turn sphere 3 into wet asphalt: base colour 41 40 39, metallic 0, smoothness 0.9.\n3. Compare it with Asphalt, wet in the Material chart.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Lit shader, 1 \xB7 Metallic and smoothness</color></size>"
