  m_text: 'A material is an asset: a shader plus its settings. Every object that uses the same material shows the same change.


    <b>Predict:</b> Change the colour of the material on sphere 1. Which spheres change?


    <b>Try:</b>

    1. Select sphere 1.

    2. In its Mesh Renderer, open the material and change the Base Map colour.

    3. Compare the material names on all four spheres.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Material chart</color></size>'
