  m_text: "A smooth surface reflects a picture of its surroundings. Away from any Reflection Probe, it reflects the scene's general picture.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Both spheres use the same material. Does the one in the box reflect the red walls?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Add a Reflection Probe inside the box (GameObject \u203A Light \u203A Reflection Probe).\n2. Fit its box to the room and set Type to Baked.\n3. Click Bake.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Lit shader, 1 \xB7 Metallic and smoothness</color></size>"
