  m_text: "A real non-metal has a base colour between 32 (man-made black) and 243 (snow), in sRGB values from 0 to 255.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Which of these four spheres are outside that range?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Open each sphere's material.\n2. Read its Base Map colour (RGB, 0\u2013255).\n3. Bring the ones outside the range back inside it.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Material chart, 1 \xB7 Reference values</color></size>"
