  m_text: "One mesh can be made of several parts. The Mesh Renderer draws each part with its own material slot, in its Materials list.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> The bench is one mesh, with one material. Why is part of it missing?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select the bench.\n2. In the Mesh Renderer, add a second element to Materials.\n3. Assign Brushed steel (Asset Library, Materials \u203A Textured).\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Textured materials, 4 \xB7 Metals</color></size>"
